# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 4 (a building `match` adds no path segment), ch. 8 (`<-` binds the child's result; a widget application is transparent), Type System ch. 2 ("Bundles": a name binds the bundle whole) and ruling TC (places counted as built: the loud arm builds place 0, so the button is 1, the "named" label 2 and the page's label 3; the soft arm builds none, so they are 0, 1 and 2).
